 and solve for $v$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} 3u - 10v - 24 &= 0 \\\\ 3(4 - 2v) - 10v - 24 &= 0 \\\\ 12 - 6v - 10v - 24 &= 0 \\\\ -12 - 16v &= 0 \\\\ -16v &= 12 \\\\ v &= -\\dfrac{3}{4} \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we now substitute\n\n$$\nv=-\\dfrac{3}{4}\n$$\n\ninto equation $\\color{red}(1)$, then we can find the value of $u$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} 3u - 10v - 24 &= 0 \\\\ 3u - 10\\left(-\\dfrac{3}{4}\\right) - 24 &= 0 \\\\ 3u + \\dfrac{15}{2} - 24 &= 0 \\\\ 3u - \\dfrac{33}{2} &= 0 \\\\ 3u &= \\dfrac{33}{2} \\\\ u &= \\dfrac{11}{2} \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the system of equations is $u=\\dfrac{11}{2}$ and\n\n$$\nv=-\\dfrac{3}{4}\n$$\n\n, which can be written as\n\n$$\n\\left(\\dfrac{11}{2},-\\dfrac{3}{4}\\right)\n$$" 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505063 1080 "x = \\dfrac{31}{5}, y = -\\dfrac{11}{10}" 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505063 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505063 1083 #uuid "bcc54da3-d9e3-59a1-99b4-05f22aa87741" 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505064 1080 "x = \\dfrac{13}{3}, y = -\\dfrac{2}{3}" 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505064 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505064 1083 #uuid "c0951927-a913-5192-9133-898c36910349" 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505065 1080 "a = 31, b = 36" 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505065 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505065 1083 #uuid "c22e9a45-ce60-5743-bfae-86b5026038eb" 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505066 1075 #edb/ref 17592186505011 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505066 1075 #edb/ref 17592186505032 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505066 1075 #edb/ref 17592186505040 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505066 1075 #edb/ref 17592186505054 13194139535454 17592186045443 true] [17592186505066 1075 #edb/ref 17592186505058 13194139535454 175921860